        "text": "**Refining Negation Strategy**\n\nI\u0027m now refining the negation technique for identifying \"Necessary Assumption\" flaws, focusing on the test where negated answers must weaken the argument. I am prioritizing evaluating how the negation of the correct answer directly undermines the conclusion and evaluating for \"Out of Scope\" answer traps. I\u0027m noting examples of how to negate keywords like \"always\" or \"never,\" which will inform identifying \"Must be False\" traps.\n\n\n",
