        "text": "**Analyzing Assumption Requirements**\n\nI\u0027m now analyzing the guide\u0027s section on \"Necessary Assumption\" questions, focusing on the two main stimulus tendencies: Idea Math, identifying missing logical links, and Possible Objections, anticipating counter-arguments. I am noting that conditional logic, chained ideas, or repeated ideas often point to a missing link answer.\n\n\n",
