        "text": "**Analyzing Causal Language**\n\nI\u0027m now identifying causal language within \"Curious Fact\" questions, focusing on phrases like \"correlated with,\" \"associated with,\" \"more likely to,\" and \"less likely to.\" I\u0027m reviewing examples with an emphasis on comparing results with potential explanations. I am analyzing potential correlations and working on why this is relevant.\n\n\n",
        "thought": true
