        "thought": true
      }, {
        "text": "**Interpreting Paradox Questions**\n\nI\u0027m now analyzing paradox questions and their key components, like causality and comparisons. I am focusing on identifying differences within similar elements. I\u0027m actively looking for causal difference-makers to explain apparent inconsistencies. The questions often hinge on how something positive appears as negative, or vice versa.\n\n\n",
