        "text": "**Evaluating False Answers**\n\nI\u0027m now focused on common incorrect answer patterns for \"Must Be False,\" noting the traps to avoid, such as \"too strong\" language, \"out of scope\" claims, and reversed conditional logic. I\u0027m also preparing to identify and reject \"unknown comparisons\" made from absolute adjectives, and to distinguish \"contradicted\" answers from the text. I am now applying to a test.\n\n\n",
