      }, {
        "text": "ouns, like \\\"this, that, they, such\\\")\\n\\nIf so, we want to take the"
      }, {
        "text": " time to replace the pronoun with its reference language.\\nF.e. Some people propose laws that would require mandatory background checks before owning a"
      }, {
