      }, {
        "text": " the conclusion back to ourselves.\\n\\\"Okay, the conclusion is that [laws requiring mandatory background checks] won\u0027t"
      }, {
        "text": " affect the homicide rate.\\\"\\n\\nReading Goal\\n\\n1. Find the conclusion.\\n2. Make sure"
      }, {
        "text": " that it\\n3. Sounds like Author\u0027s Opinion (facts ≠ conclusions)\\n4. Is Supported by at"
      }, {
        "text": " least one explicit claim.\\n\\nCorrect Answer\\n\\nThe correct answer just reproduces the meaning of the Conclusion."
      }, {
